 "notes": "Quick Actions, View Options, Undo, Panes\n- Quick Actions on the right-click menu: Compress Video (presets or your own size), Export as GIF, Remove Audio, Keep Audio Only, Convert Image (JPEG, PNG, WebP, TIFF, BMP) and Create PDF from pictures.\n- View Options (Ctrl+J): a folder can always open in its own view, sort, icon size and columns, its subfolders too if you like. Group the list by type, date or size.\n- Undo and Redo (Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y) for rename, move, copy, delete (back from the Recycle Bin), new folder, Tidy Up and Flatten.\n- Panes: split the window (Ctrl+\\ or ⋯ ▸ Split Right / Split Down) into up to four browsers side by side; drag the edge to resize. The window opens again with its panes.\n- Fixes: menus stay inside a small window; the list no longer scrolls sideways in a narrow window.",
